# Remove once Spring Boot's BOM reaches pgjdbc 42.7.12 or later.
# Not exploitable: we don't connect with channelBinding=require.
CVE-2026-54291

# Remove once Spring Boot's BOM reaches httpcore5 5.4.3 or later.
# Not exploitable: httpcore5 only serves as the Elasticsearch REST client
# transport against our own cluster; inbound HTTP is handled by Tomcat.
CVE-2026-54399
